                    <MudText Typo="Typo.body2" Class="mud-text-secondary">Spearman ρ ≥ 0.85 · Avg |Δ rank| ≤ 8.0 · Top-10 overlap ≥ 7/10. Run after any DFV pipeline execution to measure calibration drift. Current best: ρ = -10.02 (needs improvement).</MudText>
